# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stranglethorn Vale

step Grom'gol Base Camp
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The flight lands at Grom'gol. Stranglethorn's harder errands, carried from your first visit, fit you now: the Skullsplitter chief, Zanzil's camps, Booty Bay's pirates, the naga coast and Mokk, before the Swamp of Sorrows and the Undercity. The Bubbling Cauldron beside Nimboya has the Skullsplitter chief's quest.
  accept 586                          -- the Bubbling Cauldron: Speaking with Gan'zulah

step Tusks and necklaces on the Skullsplitter hunt
  when level>=44
  when onquest 586
  when !complete 586
  when onquest 209,598
  along until cauldron
  tip The hunters also drop Kebok's tusks and Kin'weelay's necklaces. Collect any you still need during the cauldron hunt.
  collect 1524 quest 209.1 npc 669 @45.56,38.64 map 1434 era
  collect 3916 quest 598.1 npc 669 @45.56,38.64 map 1434 era

step Zul'Mamwe
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Ride east to the Skullsplitter ruins east of the Venture Co. mine. The headhunters, berserkers and hunters roam the ruins.
  tip Ana'thek the Cruel (45) carries the Broken Armor for Speaking with Gan'zulah: he walks the south-western ruins with two guards and sometimes stands in a small cave there. Pull the guards first.
  tip Careful: Mogh the Undying, an elite troll (level 44), stands in the southern ruins around 47.7,44.3: pull the headhunters and berserkers away from him.
  kill 669 quest 586.1                -- Skullsplitter Hunter walks around here: look inside the circle on the map
  kill 781 quest 586.2
  kill 783 quest 586.3
  collect 3909 quest 586.4            -- Ana'thek the Cruel

