  tip The Stranglethorn & Swamp guide already finished Lack of Surplus' first part and the Pool of Tears with you; its Fresh Meat and Katar's murlocs are in your log. Starting here: Dar stands inside Stonard's great hall and Fel'zerul on its top floor.
