# Route from the Polestar route simulator's Horde consensus (Tauren export),
# visits 33-38, levels 42.5-44: Tanaris, Feralas, then the way back east.
# Checked by lint, not play-tested on Forever yet. Era + known Forever quests
# only.
#
# Flow: Kargath (where the Riverglades end) -> fly to Grom'gol -> Stranglethorn's
# 43-46 errands carried from 40-50/01 in one sweep south (Zul'Mamwe, Grom'gol, the
# basilisks, the ghost pirates and Zanzil's camps, Unbagwa and Mokk, the naga coast,
# the Wild Shore, Booty Bay) -> fly Grom'gol -> fly Stonard -> the Swamp of Sorrows'
# second stay (Misty Reed Post's murlocs, Fresh Meat, Stonard; fix round 2026-11-20)
# -> fly the Undercity (Zinge's errands, Lines of Communication, training) ->
# zeppelin to Orgrimmar (training for Hunters and Shamans, riding; Druids and Paladins:
# Thunder Bluff for training; Warlocks: Ratchet for the Felsteed) -> fly
# Freewind Post -> Gadgetzan (flight path) -> eastern
# Wastewander camps -> Gadgetzan -> Steamwheedle Port -> Lost Rigger Cove ->
# southern Wastewander camps -> Steamwheedle Port (every hand-in) -> Gadgetzan ->
# fly Freewind Post -> Camp Mojache (flight path, bind) -> Woodpaw north camp
# and the Gordunni Outpost -> Mojache -> sprite darters and Woodpaw alphas ->
# Mojache -> Grimtotem camp and the Woodpaw battle map -> Mojache -> one
# sweep west: the Writhing Deep, the southern Gordunni ruins and, with the
# distress beacon, OOX-22/FE's escort from Feral Scar Vale -> Mojache (every
# hand-in) -> Shen'dralas, then Orgrimmar, Camp Mojache and Dustwallow Marsh in
# the next guide.
#
# Deviations from the simulator's order:
# - Tanaris: Gadgetzan's two bounty quests are done in the camps east and
#   south of town before Steamwheedle Port, so Lost Rigger Cove is one sweep
#   and the visit ends at the Gadgetzan flight master.
# - Feralas: hub-batched loops out of Camp Mojache (north; west and south;
#   then one sweep from the Writhing Deep west to Feral Scar Vale, re-ordered
#   for flow in 0.3.5). The beacon drops from any Feralas mob, so there is no
#   ride to the Forgotten Coast for it.
# - Binds: Gadgetzan, Thunder Bluff, the Undercity, Grom'gol and Booty Bay
#   are dropped: each is replaced before any hearth uses it. Camp Mojache is
#   kept for the hearth after the escort.
# - Dropped stops (each a flight, zeppelin or boat for a few small quests):
#   Thunder Bluff for The Black Shield (1276, 1400 XP); Patrick Garrett's
#   Reclaimed Treasures (2342) in the Undercity; the Booty Bay stop of visit 38
#   (Sunken Treasure 669 is handed in on the first Booty Bay stop of
#   forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale instead; 670 was never handed in).
#
# Class quests: Warlocks pick up the Felsteed (3631, 4490) in Orgrimmar and
# Ratchet on the way in, as in the earlier Feralas guide.
#
# Class training: the Undercity at about 45 for its classes (Warriors, Paladins, Rogues, Priests, Mages, Warlocks),
# Orgrimmar for Hunters and Shamans, Thunder Bluff for Druids (and Paladins on the way). Riding at 40: each race's own
# riding trainer (Kildar in Orgrimmar for Orcs, Genn Fairweather on Zephras Isle for Skyborne, Xar'Ti in
# Sen'jin Village, Kar Stormsinger in Bloodhoof Village, Velma Warnam in
# Brill), all optional.
#
# Zul'Farrak (`when dungeon "Zul'Farrak"`, dungeons in the route): for a character who runs it, Tran'rek's Scarab
# Shells (2865, after Tran'rek, 2864, handed in on the Gadgetzan stop) and Trenton Lighthammer's Troll Temper (3042)
# are taken on the Gadgetzan stop at about 45; the run is in 40-50/04-tanaris.
#
# Accepted here, finished later on the route: Screecher Spirits (3520,
# Steamwheedle Port: the screechers on this guide's Feralas west sweep, Yeh'kinya
# at the end of Tooga's escort), Deliver to MacKinley (2874) in Booty Bay
# around level 51 (40-50/06), A Strange Request (3121), A Grim Discovery (2976) and The
# Gordunni Orb (3002) in Orgrimmar at about 47, Ripple Recovery (650) in the
# Hinterlands, Improved Quality (7734) on the next Feralas visit.
# 0.4.0 level tidy: the second water-pouch bounty (1878, 380 XP) is left out (#2394). With the Riverglades before this
# guide you arrive at about 45, so WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting (2781, Caliph 46) and Stinglasher (7731, level 47) are
# done here, on the visits that take them.
#
# Optional: Find OOX-22/FE! (2766) and Rescue OOX-22/FE! (2767): the distress
# beacon drops about one kill in forty; the reward waits in Booty Bay.
#
# Left out: Pearl Diving (705: the export gathers the pearls but never hands
# them in). Speaking with Nezzliok (585, export visit 38 at Grom'gol) is done
# earlier, on the Zul'Mamwe loop of forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale.
# Goblin Sponsorship (fix round 2026-11-20): Pozzik takes Baron Revilgaz's word (1183, from 40-50/01's second Booty
# Bay stop) on the raceway stop, and Razzeric beside him the Eighteenth Pilot (1186). Left out: Razzeric's Tweaking
# (1187): its Seaforium Booster crate is in Dustwallow Marsh and it goes back to Razzeric at the raceway, which the
# route does not pass again after Dustwallow (its follow-ups, 1188 and 1189, go with it).

