step Fly to Gadgetzan
  only Tauren,Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage
  when taxi "Gadgetzan"
  zone Orgrimmar
  when !done tauren-riding
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"
  fly "Gadgetzan"
  zone Tanaris

step Gadgetzan
  when taxi "Gadgetzan"
  zone Tanaris
  tip Flown in: Gadgetzan's quests first, by the flight master, then the Mirage Raceway is a short ride north over the Tanaris border.
  accept 992                            -- Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser
  turnin 2864                           -- Tran'rek
  accept 1690                           -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle
  turnin 243                            -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle: Apothecary Zinge's Field Testing Kit, from the Undercity
  accept 379                            -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle: the water pouches come from the same Wastewander camps
  accept 1707                           -- Spigot Operator Luglunket

step Gadgetzan
  when taxi "Gadgetzan"
  when dungeon "Zul'Farrak"
  zone Tanaris
  tip For your Zul'Farrak run, in the next guide: Tran'rek wants scarab shells, and Trenton Lighthammer, a short walk from the flight master, Troll Temper from the Sandfury trolls.
  accept 2865                           -- Tran'rek
  accept 3042                           -- Trenton Lighthammer

step Mirage Raceway
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Flown in to Gadgetzan: the raceway is a short ride north over the Tanaris border.
  tip The road from Freewind Post to Tanaris runs past the Mirage Raceway on the Shimmering Flats: Fizzle Brassbolts is in the gnomes' camp beside the track, Pozzik and Zamek by the goblins' camp. Pozzik first, then Zamek, who runs off to keep Rizzle busy; then take Rizzle's plans from the gnomes' camp and bring them back to Pozzik.
  turnin 1137                           -- Fizzle Brassbolts: News for Fizzle, from Martek in the Badlands
  turnin 1183                           -- Pozzik: Baron Revilgaz's word, from Booty Bay
  accept 1186
  turnin 1186                           -- Razzeric, beside Pozzik
  accept 1190                           -- Pozzik
  turnin 1191 direct
  turnin 1190                           -- Rizzle's Unguarded Plans
  accept 1194
  turnin 1194                           -- Pozzik

step To Gadgetzan
  when !taxi "Gadgetzan"
  zone Tanaris
  goto 50.2,27.5 "Gadgetzan"

step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  getfp "Gadgetzan"
  accept 992                            -- Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser
  tip Gadgetzan is the walled goblin town just past the Tanaris border.
  turnin 2864                           -- Tran'rek
  accept 1690                           -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle
  turnin 243                            -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle: Apothecary Zinge's Field Testing Kit, from the Undercity
  accept 379                            -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle: the water pouches come from the same Wastewander camps
  accept 1707                           -- Spigot Operator Luglunket

step Gadgetzan
  when dungeon "Zul'Farrak"
  zone Tanaris
  tip For your Zul'Farrak run, in the next guide: Tran'rek wants scarab shells, and Trenton Lighthammer, a short walk from the flight master, Troll Temper from the Sandfury trolls.
  accept 2865                           -- Tran'rek
  accept 3042                           -- Trenton Lighthammer

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gadgetzan and the Wastewander

step Noonshade Ruins: kill these as you meet them
  zone Tanaris
  tip The bandits and thieves camp in the dunes east of Gadgetzan. Every Wastewander can carry a water pouch: Luglunket wants five, and Bilgewhizzle five more.
  tip Careful: Wastewander Rogues (level 43-44) move stealthed, so they can approach unseen.
  collect 8483 quest 1707.1
  collect 8483 quest 379.1
  kill 5616 quest 1690.2
  kill 5618 quest 1690.1

step Gadgetzan
  turnin 1690                           -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle
  accept 1691
  turnin 1707                           -- Spigot Operator Luglunket
  turnin 379                            -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle
  note Keep the Model 4711-FTZ Power Source Bilgewhizzle gave you: it starts Tanaris Field Sampling, a two-hour timer, for the Tanaris guide at about 48, on the way back north from Scrimshank's hive.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Steamwheedle Port

step Steamwheedle Port
  tip Ride north-east to the goblin harbour on the coast.
  accept 8365                           -- Haughty Modiste
  accept 2781 object 142122
  accept 2875 object 142122
  accept 8366                           -- Security Chief Bilgewhizzle, inside
  turnin 2872                           -- Stoley, inside
  accept 2873
  accept 3520                           -- Yeh'kinya: the screechers live in Feralas, on this guide's west sweep
  turnin 95296                          -- Wharfmaster Steamfizzle, on the pier: Friz's errand from the Riverglades, if you carry it

step Lost Rigger Cove: kill these as you meet them
  zone Tanaris
  tip South along the coast, the Southsea pirates hold the cove. Andre Firebeard and the stolen cargo are on the docks at its far end. Any pirate can drop a hat, the kidnappers most often.
  tip Careful: Two or three pirates stand with Andre (45), and many more pirates from the town join the fight once it starts: pull his guards away from him first.
  kill 7855 quest 8366.1
  collect 20519 quest 8365.1
  kill 7856 quest 8366.2
  kill 7858 quest 8366.4
  collect 9244 quest 2873.1 @72.1,46.7 -- Upstairs
  kill 7857 quest 8366.3
  collect 9246 quest 2875.1 @73.4,47.1
  tip The cove's pirates sometimes drop a Pirate's Footlocker: open it, and if it holds a Ship Schedule, read it to start a quest for the Security Chief in Steamwheedle Port.
  collect 9250 optional @72.6,46.9      -- Ship Schedule, from a Pirate's Footlocker
  accept 2876 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The southern loop
step Waterspring Field: kill these as you meet them
  zone Tanaris
  tip The shadow mages, rogues and assassins camp south-east of Gadgetzan.
  tip South-east of Gadgetzan the Wastewander bandits camp in the dunes; Caliph stands in the eastern camp.
  tip Careful: Wastewander Rogues keep Sneak up while out of combat, so hidden rogues can join a fight you start at a camp.
  tip Careful: Two stealthed Wastewander Rogues travel with him wherever he goes. At his spawn camp, two shadowmages and their minions are close enough to join a fight with him. Out by the towers you can fight him without them.
  kill 5617 quest 1691.3
  kill 5623 quest 1691.2
  kill 5615 quest 1691.1
  collect 8723 quest 2781.1 @61.8,38.2

step Steamwheedle Port
  tip Ride north-east back to the port: Stoley, the Haughty Modiste and the Security Chief take what Lost Rigger Cove gave you. Gadgetzan is west of it.
  turnin 8365                           -- Haughty Modiste
  turnin 2873                           -- Stoley, inside
  accept 2874                           -- for Booty Bay, around level 51 (40-50/06)
  turnin 2875                           -- Security Chief Bilgewhizzle, inside
  turnin 2876                           -- Security Chief Bilgewhizzle: the Ship Schedule, if the cove gave you one
  turnin 8366

step Gadgetzan
  turnin 2781                           -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle
  turnin 1691                           -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle
  vendor nearest

