  accept 2973                           -- Krueg Skullsplitter

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Camp Mojache

step Gordunni Outpost
  tip North of the gnolls the ogres hold a hilltop outpost; pull the ogre-magi to you. The cobalt is in the dirt mounds around the outpost, and the scroll lies on the ground inside it.
  tip Careful: Ohk'zi (level 43, elite) stands in the outpost: pull the ogres out to you, away from him.
  tip Use Orwin's Shovel on each Gordunni Dirt Mound around the outpost: the arrow goes from mound to mound.
  collect 9463 quest 2987.1
  use 9466 quest 2987.1 @74.5,30.2 map 1444
  kill 5229 quest 2975.1
  kill 5237 quest 2975.2
  kill 5232 quest 2975.3
  collect 9370 "Gordunni Scroll"
  accept 2978

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north

step Woodpaw north camp
  tip The Woodpaw gnolls camp in the hills just north-west of Mojache; any of them can drop a mane.
  tip Careful: Every Woodpaw gnoll except the Alpha runs off for help at 15% health, which can pull more gnolls into the fight.
  collect 9237 quest 2862.1

step Camp Mojache
  turnin 2862                           -- Hadoken Swiftstrider
  accept 2863                           -- Alpha Strike: one hour from now
  turnin 2975                           -- Rok Orhan walks around Camp Mojache: look inside the circle on the map
  turnin 2978
  accept 2979
  accept 2980
  turnin 2987                           -- Orwin Gizzmick

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West and south of Mojache

step Feralas: kill these as you meet them
  zone Feralas
  tip The sprite darters flit over the grove just west of Mojache; nearly every one drops a wing. The Woodpaw alphas lead the camps south-west of it: kill them within the hour.
  tip Careful: Most Alphas sit in small tent camps with 2-4 other gnolls that join the fight, and other gnolls patrol between the camps.
  collect 9369 quest 2973.1
  kill 5258 quest 2863.1

step Camp Mojache
  turnin 2973                           -- Krueg Skullsplitter
  accept 2974
  turnin 2863                           -- Hadoken Swiftstrider
  accept 2902

step Grimtotem camp
  tip The Grimtotem tauren camp beside the sprite darters' grove; raiders, naturalists and shamans all carry horns.
  tip Careful: Namida Grimtotem (level 43, elite) stands in the camp: pull the raiders and shamans away from her.
  collect 9460 quest 2974.1

step Woodpaw battle map
  tip The battle map lies in the Woodpaw camp south of Mojache.
  turnin 2902
  accept 2903

step Camp Mojache
  turnin 2974                           -- Krueg Skullsplitter
  accept 2976                           -- for Orgrimmar, around level 47
  turnin 2903                           -- Hadoken Swiftstrider
  accept 7730
  accept 7731

step The Writhing Deep
  tip The Zukk'ash hive burrows into the hills south-east of the camp; Stinglasher waits in its deepest chamber.
  tip Careful: Stinglasher is level 47: clear the hive around him and pull him alone at full health.
  collect 18961 quest 7730.1
  collect 18962 quest 7731.1 @75.6,60.9

step Ruins of Isildien: kill these as you meet them
  zone Feralas
  tip Ride west from the hive to the ogre ruins below Feral Scar Vale. Shamans, warlocks and maulers fill them; the Mage-Lords at the southern end carry the orb.
  tip Careful: the Mage-Lords (45-46) and the Shamans cast from range and the ruins are packed: pull one at a time from the edge.
  kill 5234 quest 2980.3              -- Gordunni Mauler walks around Ruins of Isildien: look inside the circle on the map
  kill 5240 quest 2980.2
  kill 5236 quest 2980.1
  collect 9371 quest 2979.1

step Feral Scar Vale yetis
  tip North-west of the ruins, the yetis den in Feral Scar Vale; every yeti there can drop a thick hide.
  collect 8973 quest 2822.1

step Rogue Vale screechers
  tip On the way back north-east towards Camp Mojache, the Rogue Vale Screechers (44-46) hunt the open ground north of Feral Scar Vale. Kill one, use Yeh'kinya's Bramble on its body before you loot it, then talk to the spirit that rises: it is friendly. Three spirits in all; Yeh'kinya takes them in Steamwheedle Port on your next Tanaris visit.
  use 10699 "Yeh'kinya's Bramble" quest 3520.1 @55.7,47.0
  talk 8612 quest 3520.1

step Homing Robot OOX-22/FE
  tip Only with the distress beacon: any beast, gnoll or ogre in Feralas can drop it, about one kill in a hundred; use it to start the quest. The robot sits in a small cave on the north side of Feral Scar Vale, just north-west of the ruins. Escort it to the dock on the Forgotten Coast; yetis and gorillas ambush you on the way. Its reward waits in Booty Bay for a later visit.
  tip Careful: Three ambushes spawn during the escort, and the robot warns you before each one. The first is 3 yetis, just after the robot leaves the cave and climbs toward the road. The second is 3 gorillas, on the path that runs along the cliff. The third is about 4 gnolls, one of them a caster, where the route turns off toward the dock.
  collect 8705 "OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon" optional
  accept 2766 optional
  turnin 2766 optional
  accept 2767 optional
  complete 2767 optional

